{
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The sanctuary...",
                "It's emitting an abnormal magic power."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No doubt it's reacting to this Incident Stone."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You there! Was it you",
                "who did all this?"
            ]
        },
        "148_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What have you done",
                "to the sanctuary?"
            ]
        },
        "156_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now I can't get inside!"
            ]
        },
        "164_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're a... Yamanba, right?",
                "So the yamanba are behind all this?"
            ]
        },
        "172_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then why don't you show me how you",
                "react to this blue Incident Stone!"
            ]
        },
        "180_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't mess around."
            ]
        },
        "188_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just hurry up and",
                "fix the sanctuary already!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's that?",
                "That blue stone...?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's a magic stone containing",
                "the power of an incident."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A seal on the sanctuary...",
                "You mean what's below us now?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems this wondrous magic power inherent to nature is",
                "the only thing that can break the seal on the sanctuary."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't know who sealed it or why,",
                "but I'll make sure to restore it."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see. If you say you'll restore it,",
                "then I won't get in your way."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Good luck, I'm counting on you!"
            ]
        }
    }
}